      "coverageNotes": [
        "U.S. House and state legislative district lists are county-certified and are not included in this statewide certification. Candidates for other district offices must be certified to the appropriate board(s) of elections by the most populous county board of elections of the district. 6 If a less- populous county of a district has not received a list of candidates, it must contact the most populous county before programming ballots. Source: https://www.ohiosos.gov/assets/dir2026-45-form-of-the-official-ballot-for-the-november%203-general-election.pdf",
        "Governor and Lieutenant Governor joint tickets are retained as one choice exactly as certified. Valid write-in tickets and Senate candidates are included; the directive does not print their party labels."
